No	prior	knowledge	or	learning	related	to	this	subject
is required before beginning the GCSE (9–1) in
Classical	Civilisation.

This	qualification	provides	the	ideal	foundation	for
learners	to	progress	to	OCR’s	AS	Level	and	A	Level	in
Classical	Civilisation.

GCSEs (9–1) enable learners to progress to further
qualifications	either	Vocational	or	General.

Find	out	more	at	www.ocr.org.uk

